'''October Gauntlet II''' (続・10月強襲！, ''Zoku・10 Gatsu Kyōshū ！'', '''Continued・October Assault!''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that only appears during October and was added in the [[Version 10.9 Update]]. It features enemies from the [[Sports Night (Monthly Event)|Sports Night]] event.

==Overview==
===About===
October Gauntlet II contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] stages, called '''Sports Night Lvs''' (大運動会 Lvs.). After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a Sports Night Lv can include [[Battle Items]], one Platinum Shard and [[Ototo Corps|Catamins]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[October Gauntlet II/Sports Night Lv.11~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*October Gauntlet II is unlocked after clearing [[Sports Night (Monthly Event)|Sports Night]].

